 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## AI agent tools (WebMCP)
+
+The sign-in and sign-up forms are also exposed to AI agents through the
+[WebMCP](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp) imperative API. When the
+browser supports `document.modelContext`, visiting `/signin` registers a
+`sign_in` tool and visiting `/signup` registers a `sign_up` tool. Each tool
+takes `username` and `password`, performs the same request as the form, mirrors
+the input in the visible form, and returns the same status message the user
+would see. Tools are unregistered when the form leaves the page.
+
+To try it locally, enable `chrome://flags/#enable-webmcp-testing` in Chrome and
+inspect the registered tools from DevTools.
